  message: "OWNER RULING 2026-11-23 (in session), verbatim: \"yes to A and to reading the two Rust forms. For B, sort the arguments and nothing more; do not try to evaluate the conditions.\" As put to the owner: A = C and C++ #ifdef/#if alternatives enter the stable id, as Rust #[cfg] and Swift #if do; the two Rust forms = inner #![cfg(...)] and cfg_attr(..., cfg(...)) are read; B = a predicate's arguments are sorted so any(a, b) and any(b, a) hash alike, and conditions are never evaluated. The v19 bump is approved (\"yes I approve the v19 bump\")."  # 2758
